  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "William Edward Boeing was an American aviation pioneer and founder of the Seattle aircraft manufacturer that bears his name. He inherited timberlands and mineral wealth, expanded his lumber interests and established an aircraft business. After withdrawing from aviation, he devoted himself to personal investments, property development and breeding thoroughbred racehorses.",
    "html": "<p>William Edward Boeing was an American aviation pioneer and founder of the Seattle aircraft manufacturer that bears his name. He inherited timberlands and mineral wealth, expanded his lumber interests and established an aircraft business. After withdrawing from aviation, he devoted himself to personal investments, property development and breeding thoroughbred racehorses.</p>\r\n",
